{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">香港小姐2026｜8號鄧匡閔（Ada）勇奪亞軍！鄧匡閔身高174cm，是今屆最高的一位，6月時鄧匡閔體重報稱54.7公斤，經過2個月地獄式減肥，8月時體重只有49公斤，激減5.7kg（約12.5磅），足證她毅力十足。 </p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">學歷方面，鄧匡閔畢業於英國著名的京斯頓大學，主修時裝設計，她報稱職業是高定品牌版師助理，之前一直在英國倫敦工作。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"cb2e6943-1316-4ae6-aa5a-b94d7a0f.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026JJB3TKcwnB1788102542.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"cb2e6943-1316-4ae6-aa5a-b94d7a0f.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"698c7823-8abb-4094-a6fc-c2029948.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026KaIJQSbg9q1788102529.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"698c7823-8abb-4094-a6fc-c2029948.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-30T15:19:09.881681+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":165,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}